<title>UK: UK's Clarke says 1997 GDP forecast is very sound [CORRECTED 12:47 GMT].</title>
<headline>UK's Clarke says 1997 GDP forecast is very sound [CORRECTED 12:47 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke said on Monday his forecast of 1997 GDP growth of 3.5 percent looks safe.</p>
<p>(Corrects figure from 2.5 percent).</p>
<p>&quot;The growth forecast for the next year looks very sound,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
